*flock* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''flock(handle, operation)''

Applies file locking operations to a file handle.

*Parameters:*
- ''handle'': File handle
- ''operation'': Number lock operation (see ''libhandles.chh'')

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if handle is invalid

*Misc:*
- Use ''LOCKSH'' (shared), ''LOCKEX'' (exclusive), ''LOCKUN'' (unlock)
- Add ''LOCKNB'' for non-blocking: ''LOCKSH + LOCKNB'' or ''LOCKEX + LOCKNB''
